Open Food Facts — barcode nutrition data
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
https://world.openfoodfacts.org
Database: Open Database License (ODbL) v1.0
Contents: Database Contents License (DbCL) v1.0

Queried live, one request per barcode the user looks up, and only the fields
this app stores are requested. No part of the database is bundled, mirrored or
redistributed, so no derived database is created and the ODbL share-alike
obligation is not triggered. Product images (CC BY-SA 4.0) are not used at all.

Attribution is shown in the app under Settings -> Credits and in the barcode
lookup sheet itself.

